  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 1026.05,
      "end": 1028.65,
      "text": "I'm just showcasing the videography."
    },
    {
      "start": 1028.74,
      "end": 1029.24,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 1029.8,
      "end": 1037.59,
      "text": "And in fact, for videography, I had made a system last year"
    },
    {
      "start": 1038.15,
      "end": 1040.99,
      "text": "that if you put the videography directly in the website,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1041.47,
      "end": 1044.45,
      "text": "it impacts the fact that when the website loads,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1045.13,
      "end": 1046.49,
      "text": "then there are MBs."
    },
    {
      "start": 1046.97,
      "end": 1049.67,
      "text": "When the website loads, your MBs are downloaded."
    },
    {
      "start": 1050.45,
      "end": 1054.79,
      "text": "So, if the video is 50 MB, 100 MB,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1057.17,
      "end": 1065.07,
      "text": "I was not able to upload the video directly on the website."
    },
    {
      "start": 1065.07,
      "end": 1068.97,
      "text": "I used to post the video on different URL."
    },
    {
      "start": 1070.25,
      "end": 1073.33,
      "text": "I used to post the video on the website."
    },
    {
      "start": 1073.33,
      "end": 1075.33,
      "text": "I don't have to load it because of the video."
    },
    {
      "start": 1076.05,
      "end": 1078.32,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    }
  ]
